Data (data/kalpiot26.json, data/build_stats.json): CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The derived data combines per-ballot-box results from harelc/elections-vote-transfer
(ballot26.csv, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, (c) Harel Cain), itself taken from the Israeli Central
Elections Committee publications, with polling-place coordinates from the GovMap /
CEC layer 243675 as cached in shaielc/Behirot. Changes: joined on the ballot-box ID,
grouped by building, reformatted to compact JSON. Raw source files are not
redistributed here; scripts/build_data.py downloads them.
